      "id": "t22_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": -616,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Cache: skip work when inputs are stable\n\n`region/cache` runs its body only when an input changes. Wrap an expensive computation inside it and the runtime returns the same output every tick until you nudge an input.\n\nHere: a 200-point Fibonacci scatter, cached. The Path is rebuilt only when `scale` changes.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Cache: skip work when inputs are stable\n\n`region/cache` runs its body only when an input changes. Wrap an expensive computation inside it and the runtime returns the same output every tick until you nudge an input.\n\nHere: a 200-point Fibonacci scatter, cached. The Path is rebuilt only when `scale` changes.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
